# command: node probe.mjs <sha256 of expected value>  (probe: LLMFactory.createLLM(id) then getClient(); run from autobyteus-server-ts so autobyteus-ts resolves to its dist)

--- variable unset
deepseek-v4-flash -> missing_api_key: API key not provided for DEEPSEEK. Configure the DEEPSEEK API key before sending a request.
grok-4.7          -> missing_api_key: API key not provided for GROK. Configure the GROK API key before sending a request.
--- only AUTOBYTEUS_TEST_VAULT=<tmp>/vault set
deepseek-v4-flash -> key resolved (sha256 matches expected DeepSeek value: true)
grok-4.7          -> missing_api_key: missing capability provider.grok.api-key for GROK (test vault <tmp>/vault); add it with pnpm test-vault setup
